<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Nov industrial output up 3.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Nov industrial output up 3.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Nov	 Oct	 Nov 95</p>
<p> Mth/mth change (pct)		-0.6	 3.1	  5.4</p>
<p> Yr/yr change (pct)		   3.6	 9.9	  0.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		  110.7     111.3	108.9</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
